Place licensed GT America webfont files here (do not copy from third-party websites):

- GTAmerica-Regular.woff2 (weight 400, normal)
- GTAmerica-Medium.woff2 (weight 500, normal)
- GTAmerica-Italic.woff2 (weight 400, italic)

Until these files are present, the site uses the CSS stack `"GT America", Arial, sans-serif` and renders with Arial.
